Enable Docker-required kernel options in verdin_imx8mp_defconfig.

The TorizonOS dev-lvgl capsule runs dockerd, which needs at minimum:
  - CONFIG_BRIDGE + CONFIG_BRIDGE_NETFILTER for the docker0 bridge
  - CONFIG_NF_NAT, CONFIG_IP_NF_NAT, MASQUERADE for outbound NAT
  - netfilter XTABLES + addrtype/conntrack/mark/nat matches
  - CONFIG_VETH (already =y), CONFIG_DUMMY, CONFIG_VXLAN, CONFIG_VLAN_8021Q
  - CONFIG_NF_CT_NETLINK for ctnetlink (docker uses libnetfilter_conntrack)

Without these, dockerd fails at startup ("failed to create endpoint" /
"iptables: No chain/target/match by that name") and the daemon never
reaches a ready state.

Signed-off-by: EDGEMTech <info@edgemtech.ch>

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/verdin_imx8mp_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/verdin_imx8mp_defconfig
@@ -1039,11 +1039,21 @@ CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_PPTP=y
 # CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_SANE is not set
 # CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_SIP is not set
 # CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_TFTP is not set
-# CONFIG_NF_CT_NETLINK is not set
+CONFIG_NF_CT_NETLINK=y
 # CONFIG_NF_CT_NETLINK_TIMEOUT is not set
-# CONFIG_NF_NAT is not set
+CONFIG_NF_NAT=y
+CONFIG_NF_NAT_REDIRECT=y
+CONFIG_NF_NAT_MASQUERADE=y
 # CONFIG_NF_TABLES is not set
-# CONFIG_NETFILTER_XTABLES is not set
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XTABLES=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MARK=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_CONNMARK=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_NAT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_TARGET_MASQUERADE=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_ADDRTYPE=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_CONNTRACK=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_IPVS=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_MARK=y
 # end of Core Netfilter Configuration

 # CONFIG_IP_SET is not set
@@ -1059,7 +1069,11 @@ CONFIG_NF_DEFRAG_IPV4=y
 # CONFIG_NF_LOG_ARP is not set
 # CONFIG_NF_LOG_IPV4 is not set
 # CONFIG_NF_REJECT_IPV4 is not set
-# CONFIG_IP_NF_IPTABLES is not set
+CONFIG_IP_NF_IPTABLES=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_FILTER=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_TARGET_REJECT=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_NAT=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_TARGET_MASQUERADE=y
 # CONFIG_IP_NF_ARPTABLES is not set
 # end of IP: Netfilter Configuration

@@ -1075,15 +1089,16 @@ CONFIG_NF_DEFRAG_IPV4=y
 # end of IPv6: Netfilter Configuration

 CONFIG_NF_DEFRAG_IPV6=y
-# CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_BRIDGE is not set
+CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK_BRIDGE=y
 # CONFIG_BPFILTER is not set
 # CONFIG_IP_DCCP is not set
